Recommends: python3-pycrdt
Description: Real-time collaborative text editor (CRDT)
 ShareBoard is a Google-Docs-style real-time collaborative editor. Each
 board is a CRDT document (Yjs via pycrdt on the server, y-prosemirror in
 the browser). Multiple users can edit the same board simultaneously with
 presence (remote cursors and names). All edits are persisted to a local
 SQLite database and survive server restarts.
